WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:04.110
BRENNAN CHAPMAN: So Moonbot is
a multi-platform storytelling

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:04.790
company.

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:06.990
A lot of the mediums we
use involve 3D animation.

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:09.040
Google Cloud Platform
allows us to augment

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.120
our local on-premise render farm
to make sure that we're always

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.540
able to render
whatever render load is

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.500
on our farm in an
efficient amount of time.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.270
We worked on a project last
year called "Taking Flight."

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.070
A lot of the scenes involved a
lot of render time to compute.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:26.770
So the cloud enabled us to
shrink the wait time that we

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:27.930
had to do on the compute.

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:31.060
And we could use both our local
compute capabilities as well as

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:33.360
the cloud to render everything
in a much shorter amount

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.540
of time, which thus
allowed our creative team

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:38.140
to produce better results.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:40.330
As we take on new and
bigger challenges at Moonbot

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:42.829
it's really reassuring to know
that we have the Google Cloud

00:00:42.829 --> 00:00:44.730
platform suite of
tools and services,

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.880
as well as partner
technologies such as Avere,

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:51.730
that can enable us to achieve
anything we can dream.

